    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a strategy single-player game where players need to make plans based on the terrain, and each move and decision needs to be carefully considered, controlling the character's movement to achieve victory conditions. Players who like strategy games should not miss it! The game is set in a cold winter, icy and snowy forest. Your goal is to control the main squirrel and collect all the pine cones on the frozen lake and leave the ice, requiring the player to use logical thinking and spatial imagination to plan the order and path of movement. The game has a total of 63 levels, each of which is carefully designed, and the difficulty of the levels will increase as the level increases, making it more challenging. The game's graphics and UI are simple and straightforward, and the music is relaxed and casual, allowing players to focus on the puzzle-solving process.</p>",
